  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Cities Climate Finance Leadership Alliance II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Cities Climate Finance Leadership Alliance II (CCFLA II) is a follow up project of CCFLA, a global coalition of institutions committed to increasing finance for city-level climate action. This grant funds the implementation of CCFLA&#x2019;s outreach strategy, especially through effective communication activities, regional and global events, and the development of a knowledge hub. The grant also supports CCFLA in implementing its advocacy strategy and activities associated with hosting the Leadership of Urban Climate Investment (LUCI) framework - focused on tracking progress and promoting project-level collaboration between CCFLA members&#x2019; initiatives. CCFLA II also focusses on strengthening local structures.</narrative>
  </description>
